      "",
      "On Sunday, Leng Xiaoxi uses her junior’s student card again and enters Xijing University.",
      "",
      "“Senior, you’ve come?” Gao Ming and his friends arrive.",
      "",
      "“Hello, everyone,” Leng Xiaoxi says.",
      "",
      "“Hello, senior!” “Hello, senior!” “Senior, you’re very pretty!” Gao Ming’s friends says.",
      "",
